>> title: Chiffon Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: sponge, eggs, vanilla, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Dim Sum Counter
>> aka: sponge cake, gai daan gou, 雞蛋糕, Chinese sponge cake
>> servings: 12
>> time: 2 hr 30 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C).

Whisk @egg yolks{7%large}, @vegetable oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @whole milk{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Whisk @cake flour{2%cup}(225 g), @granulated sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @baking powder{1%Tbs}(12 g), @table salt{1%tsp}(6 g) into @&(~1)yolk mixture{}.

Whip @egg whites{7%large}, @cream of tartar{1/2%tsp}(1.5 g), @granulated sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g) to stiff peaks.

Fold @&(~1)meringue{} into @&(3)yolk batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} in a #10-in tube pan{} at 325°F for ~{55%min}, then cool upside down.
